---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Ashbi Design" description="How the Ashbi Design website handles contact and booking links." noindex={true}><main id="main"><section class="interior-hero container"><span class="eyebrow">SITE INFORMATION</span><h1>Your privacy <em>matters.</em></h1><p>This page describes the current local website build. It needs a final review once hosting, analytics, and the booking provider are confirmed.</p></section><section class="section container article-body"><h2>Contacting Ashbi</h2><p>This website links to an email address and a separate booking service. If you email us, the information you send is handled through your and our email providers. If you follow a booking link, the booking provider's privacy terms apply.</p><h2>Website data</h2><p>The project brief form uses your name, email address, selected service, and project details to respond to an enquiry. Company, website, and timing are optional. Online submission is unavailable until a delivery endpoint is configured. The email option opens a draft in your email app and does not send automatically. This local build has no newsletter signup or external analytics service. Interaction events are available locally for future measurement and do not contain form values. A production host may process technical information such as IP addresses in its server logs; the final policy should describe the selected host and retention period.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p></section></main></BaseLayout>
